(850,1776,'Rheumatoid arthritis of children occurring in three major subtypes defined by the symptoms present during the first six months following onset: systemic-onset (Still&#39;s Disease, Juvenile-Onset) polyarticular-onset, and pauciarticular-onset. Adult-onset cases of Still&#39;s disease (STILL&#39;S DISEASE, ADULT-ONSET) are also known. Only one subtype of juvenile rheumatoid arthritis (polyarticular-onset, rheumatoid factor-positive) clinically resembles adult rheumatoid arthritis and is considered its childhood equivalent.','en',2,'2026-10-08 22:02:05',NULL,NULL,'11136FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
(851,1780,'A sharply elevated, irregularly shaped, progressively enlarging scar resulting from formation of excessive amounts of collagen in the dermis during connective tissue repair. It is differentiated from a hypertrophic scar (CICATRIX, HYPERTROPHIC) in that the former does not spread to surrounding tissues.','en',2,'2026-10-08 22:02:05',NULL,NULL,'11122FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
(852,1797,'A term used pathologically to describe BILIRUBIN staining of the BASAL GANGLIA; BRAIN STEM; and CEREBELLUM and clinically to describe a syndrome associated with HYPERBILIRUBINEMIA. Clinical features include athetosis, MUSCLE SPASTICITY or hypotonia, impaired vertical gaze, and DEAFNESS. Nonconjugated bilirubin enters the brain and acts as a neurotoxin, often in association with conditions that impair the BLOOD-BRAIN BARRIER (e.g., SEPSIS). This condition occurs primarily in neonates (INFANT, NEWBORN),  but may rarely occur in adults. (Menkes, Textbook of Child Neurology, 5th ed, p613)','en',2,'2026-10-08 22:02:06',NULL,NULL,'11109FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
(853,1800,'Disorders whose essential features are the failure to resist an impulse, drive, or temptation to perform an act that is harmful to the individual or to others. Individuals experience an increased sense of tension prior to the act and pleasure, gratification or release of tension at the time of committing the act.','en',2,'2026-10-08 22:02:06',NULL,NULL,'11099FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
