(1399,2978,'Form of leukemia characterized by an uncontrolled proliferation of the myeloid lineage and their precursors in the bone marrow and other sites.','en',2,'2026-10-08 22:02:17',NULL,NULL,'4329FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
