(1411,3001,'Involuntary discharge of urine after the age at which urinary control should have been achieved; often used alone with specific reference to involuntary discharge of urine occurring during sleep at night (bed-wetting; nocturnal enuresis). (Dorland, 27th ed)','en',2,'2026-10-08 22:02:17',NULL,NULL,'4239FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
